// lowRISC/opentitan TL-UL library -- 14 modules (hw/common/tlul/rtl).
// The TL-UL bus cells the OpenTitan cores and the TT AXI-Lite-to-TL-UL bridges
// use. Each file keeps the lowRISC header, "Copyright lowRISC contributors
// (OpenTitan project)." at line 1. TT carries local edits in this copy (the
// OCAH_OT_ASSERT macros, for example dataWidthOnly32_A in tlul_err.sv), but the header is not
// Tenstorrent, so the logic is third-party by the same rule as the OpenTitan
// block above. The TT bridges around these cells -- axi_lite_to_tlul and
// tlul_to_axi_lite (hw/common/axi) -- stay graded.
